        "text": "Outbound product identity strings use the new brand: image-download and image-search User-Agent Kiokoto/1.0, NHK feed and LotoLab User-Agent tokens, Unsplash utm_source=kiokoto (with the asserting tests updated to the new contract)"
      },
      {
        "id": "AC3",
        "text": "User-facing attribution lines in life-feed content (weather, geography) credit Kiokoto; the privacy data-export download filename uses the kiokoto-export- prefix, matching the web client"
      },
      {
        "id": "AC4",
        "text": "The Shiba mentor system prompt introduces the platform as Kiokoto"
      },
      {
        "id": "AC5",
        "text": "Infrastructure defaults are NOT renamed: /srv/kotobawork paths and the no-reply@kotobawork.local fallback in config stay untouched; stored-data test fixtures keep the old string"
      },
      {
        "id": "AC6",
        "text": "go build ./... passes and suite_go is green"
      }
